    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d338">

                <pb facs="0729" n="633" sameAs="frus:frus1945Malta/pg633"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">Hopkins Papers</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The President’s Special Assistant</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Hopkins</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the President
                        </hi><anchor n="1" xml:id="d338-f1"/>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">[<placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Yalta</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1945-02-05">February 5, 1945.</date>]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p rendition="#flush">
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Mr. President</hi>:—</p>
                <p>I would suggest that you say this is a very important and urgent matter and that
                    the three foreign ministers present a proposal tomorrow as to the <hi
                        rendition="#italic">proceedure</hi> by which a determination as to to
                    dismemberment can be arrived at an early date</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Harry</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
